## NEFARAM-Rhiven integration notes (local project)

- **Body:** CBBE 3BA is used in the Rhiven setup; choose **CBBE 3BA** in the FOMOD if that matches the built body.
- **Old SLIF:** do not run the old framework and SLIF NG together; review existing old-SLIF patches before installation.
- **Estrus Chaurus+:** its copied description credits SLIF integration, but real behavior with this NG replacement still needs in-game testing.
- **BeeingFemale NG 3.6.8:** already installed; monitor simultaneous inflation requests and the actor diagnostics page during tests.
- **OviBody / Curse of Life:** not part of the intended Rhiven setup.

*The statements above are integration checkpoints, not claims that a complete compatibility test has passed.*
